  "description": "NHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Clients provides a Standard compliant client for recording\n\t\t\taudits and metrics. Writes are validated and stamped on the caller's thread and dispatched\n\t\t\tin the background, and completed metric spans are replayed to an ActivitySource for\n\t\t\ttelemetry. Storage, identity and request tracing are supplied by the host through the\n\t\t\tNHSOneLondon.AuditAndMetrics.Abstractions ports.",
